---
const { github } = Astro.props as { github: string };
---
<section id="oss" class="section">
  <h2 class="section-title"><span class="tag" style="--tag: var(--green)"></span>Open source</h2>
  <p class="lead">
    My homelab runs as code: Ansible collections for k3s, Docker services, servers, macOS
    workstations and hosting; roles for OpenWrt and Keenetic routers; a Terraform module for
    Proxmox; and a Claude Code plugin that turns camera footage into a summary video.
  </p>
  <p><a href={github}>All projects on GitHub →</a></p>
</section>

<style>
  .lead {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
</style>
